    "Masked-target separation is positive across all categories, with stronger margins in Movies and CDs. Industrial and Electronics have more weak-margin positions (10.93% and 10.25%); Electronics has the lowest selected validation HR@10 (0.445).",
    "User representations occupy fewer effective dimensions than item embeddings, especially in Industrial (RankMe 17.34 versus 48.75), but retain nonzero centered variation; these measurements do not establish collapse.",
