  "key_implications": [
    "The model separates observed masked positives from sampled negatives, but these training margins do not establish held-out ranking quality.",
    "Representation concentration is most pronounced in Industrial; directional alignment alone does not establish reduced recommendation diversity.",
    "Branch-allocation effects cannot be inferred reliably from the inconsistent protocol descriptions or diagnostic terminal-position coverage."
  ],
